  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/T1cDttyv/farmers-knives-banner.png\" alt=\"农夫的刀\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">为《农夫乐事》（Farmer's Delight）添加了多种模组材质制成的刀具！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>支持列表：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adabranium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">阿达布拉尼姆</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">振金</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">艾德曼合金</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">下界砖</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Additional Additions</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">玫瑰金</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">镶金下界合金</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-netherite-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Advanced Netherite</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">下界合金-铁</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">下界合金-金</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">下界合金-绿宝石</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">下界合金-钻石</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aphid-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aphid Additions</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">几丁质</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterEnd</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">瑟拉西姆</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">终结合金</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">永恒合金</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterNether</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">辛辛那提石</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">辛辛那提石-钻石</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">下界红宝石</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">人力钢</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">元素钢</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">大地钢</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/conjuring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Conjuring</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">灵魂合金</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-age-backport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Copper Age Backport</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">铜</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Stuff and Additions</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">黄铜<br>锌</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deeperdarker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deeper and Darker</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">监守者</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragonloot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dragon Loot</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">龙</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-emerald-tools-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy Emerald Tools &amp; More</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">绿宝石</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">红宝石</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">紫水晶</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">钢</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">黑曜石</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">铜</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/end-reborn-mc\" rel=\"nofollow\">End Reborn</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">残响</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">羽焰</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderite-mod-for-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderite Mod</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">末地合金</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gobber-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gobber</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">戈伯</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\