le=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">潮汐歌者</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">彭多合金</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/progression-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\">Progression Reborn</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">铜</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">玫瑰金</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Twilight Forest</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">铁木</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">烈焰木</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">钢叶</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">骑士金属</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillabackport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Backport</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">铜</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/winterly\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Winterly</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">冰晶大理石</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>截至 2.1 版本的所有刀具：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/8zPxdqC/image-2022-08-17-164723137.png\" alt=\"刀具\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">（不包含暮色森林、Adabranium